    "show_share": true,
    "description": "What does it mean to truly grow in nursing, beyond skills and certifications? For Lilian Karanja, a critical care nurse, educator, and current postgraduate student at the Aga Khan University, the answer came in the form of reflection. That insight led her to create  The Reflective Nurs e, a guided journal designed to help nurses make sense of their everyday clinical experiences and deepen their professional growth.",
